  "title": {
    "zh": "气闸出入校验",
    "en": "Pressure Gate Log Audit"
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "栈 · 第一处断点 · 最深层数",
    "en": "Stack · First error · Deepest nesting"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "events 记录穿过多层气闸的动作，每条为 [动作, 非空舱名]。enter 进入下一层，exit 必须退出最近进入且尚未退出的舱，允许同名舱嵌套。返回 [故障位置, 应退出的舱名, 故障前到过的最大层数]。编号从 0 开始。空栈退出时舱名填空字符串。日志结束仍有未退出的舱时，故障位置填日志长度，舱名填当前最内层。全部正确时交 [-1, \"\", 最大层数]。",
    "en": "Each entry in events is [action, nonempty chamber name]. enter goes one level deeper and exit must leave the most recently entered chamber still open. Chamber names can repeat at different depths. Return [first bad event index, chamber that should be exited, greatest depth reached before the error]. Indices start at zero. For an exit from an empty stack, use the empty string for the chamber. If a chamber is left open at the end, use the log length as the error index and name the innermost chamber. If the log is valid, return [-1, \"\", greatest depth]."
  },
  "hints": [],
  "functionName": "audit_pressure_gates",
  "starterCode": "def audit_pressure_gates(events):\n    pass\n",
  "solutionCode": "def audit_pressure_gates(events):\n    open_gates = []\n    deepest = 0\n    for index in range(len(events)):\n        event = events[index]\n        if event[0] == \"enter\":\n            open_gates.append(event[1])\n            if len(open_gates) > deepest:\n                deepest = len(open_gates)\n        else:\n            if len(open_gates) == 0:\n                return [index, \"\", deepest]\n            expected = open_gates[len(open_gates) - 1]\n            if event[1] != expected:\n                return [index, expected, deepest]\n            open_gates.pop()\n    if len(open_gates) > 0:\n        return [len(events), open_gates[len(open_gates) - 1], deepest]\n    return [-1, \"\", deepest]\n",
  "snippets": [
    {
      "label": {
        "zh": "查看最后进入的舱",
        "en": "Read the innermost chamber"
